==Battleground==
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 6.67~8.67 seconds<sup>200f~260f</sup>.
*1 [[Sonic (Enemy)|Sonic]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

